      "facts": [
        {
          "statement": "CJP held a 'Jail Bharo Andolan' at Shivaji Park, Dadar, Mumbai on Friday 2 October 2026 (Gandhi Jayanti), called for 4 pm and led by founder-convenor Abhijeet Dipke.",
