          ]
        },
        {
          "statement": "CJP's reported demands: resignation of the CEC (and proceedings against him); a freeze on SIR and restoration of the January 2025 electoral roll; an independent inquiry into SIR decision-making; and repeal of the 2023 law on appointing Election Commissioners. Wording differs between outlets.",
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            "https://theprint.in/feature/cjps-dipke-says-nationwide-protest-if-cec-gyanesh-kumar-doesnt-resign-in-24-hours/3052008/",
