          ]
        },
        {
          "statement": "On 26 September the full Commission issued a press note stating the June 2025 SIR order was unanimous, extending SIR deadlines in Delhi and Maharashtra, and committing to circulate meeting agendas and minutes. ECI has described differing views as a normal part of deliberation.",
